  Proof.
    intros m1 h jrest jdt jrs jsy j80 j24 c1 c2 x1 x5 x6 x7 x11 x12 x13 x14 x15 x16 x17 x28 x29 x30 x31 RS SOK RET1 SRCB MTL DT0 DTA DTL W0 WA WL LOS SPB SPA DJ RDT RDJ LJD HWr LJR RKr RSa LRS SYa LSY FRa NSr TLr FRb ST MU WM MI.
